# Publish-gate exemptions: <rule-id> <path-glob>, read from HEAD by publish-gate.sh.
# The hub writes record cross-references in double square brackets around the
# record id, which is also the syntax of the house-memory-link rule. `make check` fails on any [[x]] in these
# files (tests/ aside) that is not a record id, so a real memory link still stops.
house-memory-link  curation/records/*.yaml
house-memory-link  data/catalog.json
house-memory-link  data/catalog.tsv
house-memory-link  docs/index.html
house-memory-link  docs/review/*.md
house-memory-link  README.md
house-memory-link  skills/*/SKILL.md
house-memory-link  tests/*
